उत्कोचक, अस्, इका, अम्, corrupted with bribes;
(अस्), m. the receiver of a bribe, a bribe; N. of a
Tīrtha.

उत्-क्राम, अस्, m. going from or out, going above,
surpassing, deviating from propriety, transgression;
opposition, contrariety.

उत्क्षिप् उत्-क्षिप् (उद्-क्˚), cl. 6. P. A. -क्षि-
पति, -ते, -क्षेप्तुम्, to throw up, raise, set up, erect;
to throw away, reject, get rid of, vomit up.

उत्-क्षेपक, अस्, आ, अम्, throwing, a thrower, who
or what elevates or raises; one who sends or orders;
(अस्), m. a stealer of clothes &c.
